{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Turn-Based Battle</h2>This classic turn-based strategy game follows a speed order system.<br>Utilize each character's effectiveness and status resistance to gain the upper hand, and use a variety of skills to defeat your enemies.<br>There are 35 stages to complete in the main storyline and a total of 50 stages to conquer on all routes. The game offers approximately 20 hours of gameplay.<br>Players can also take on additional challenges once they have completed the game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story &amp; Characters</h2>With over 50 unique characters, this game depicts the struggles between multiple factions on the continent of Elsia.<br>Relationships are tested and grudges are formed as the story unfolds.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Decision</h2>With numerous dialogue choices, your decisions will greatly impact the game's outcome.<br>Your choices can affect relationships, character life and death, and the progression of the storyline.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Award Medal</h2>Grant honors to your characters to strengthen their abilities, expand their equipment, and upgrade their skills.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">War Table</h2>Assign members to complete additional political tasks to improve the support for your faction.<br>Earn sponsorships and new equipment in the process.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Controls</h2>[Keyboard] (Mouse control available)<br>WASD / \u2191 \u2190 \u2193 \u2192: Arrow<br>Enter / Space: OK<br>Esc / Num0: Cancel<br>Ctrl: Skip dialogue<br>Page up / Page down: Next page or back to the active unit<br><br>[Gamepad] (XBOX example)<br>D-pad / left analog stick: Arrow<br>A: OK<br>B: Cancel<br>X: Skip dialogue<br>LB / RB: Next page or back to the active unit<br>Right analog stick: Mouse operation","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u63a8\u7ffb\u8352\u738b","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2298570/5fd5f2871d44c45fcce6a6308f5c043c65af016e.jpg"},{"name":"\u5e73\u5b9a\u5357\u7063","path":"https:/